# Keep products separate (always)

Products in this monorepo must never be mixed in UI, nav, logos, or marketing copy.

| Product | Touch only |
|---------|------------|
| Parslia | Root marketing (`index.html`, `styles.css`, `script.js`, `assets/`) |
| Pure Prasad Kitchen | `pure-prasad-kitchen/` |
| Menu Creator | `menu-creator/` and related menu patches |
| Libraix | `libraix/` |
| Kiteline | Explicit Kiteline/patch work only |

## Forbidden

- Linking Menu Creator or Pure Prasad from the Parslia landing nav/hero/features
- Parslia branding on Menu Creator or Pure Prasad pages
- Calling unrelated tools “part of Parslia”
- Single PRs that cross-wire two customer-facing brands

## Required

- One product per task / PR title
- Read `PRODUCTS.md` and `AGENTS.md` before cross-folder edits
- If the user names a product, stay inside that product’s folder wall
